  guideTitle: "How High to Hang a Light in a Living Room: Heights From Sightlines",
  metaTitle: "How High to Hang a Living Room Light",
  metaDescription: "Hang pendants 30 to 36 inches over a coffee table, check ceiling fixture clearance, match shade height to seated eye level and avoid bare bulb glare.",
  heroImage: "/images/articles/hang-light-hero.webp",
